{"seq":10,"slug":"data-intensive-applications","title":"数据密集型应用设计","stage":"DONE","category":"cloud-infrastructure","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications","rating":{"composite":3.89,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.42,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 数据密集型应用设计 简介\n\n数据密集型应用设计是分布式系统领域的核心知识体系，源自 Martin Kleppmann 的经典著作及其 2026 年第二版的重大更新。它系统化地阐述了现代数据系统在可靠性、可扩展性和可维护性三个维度上的设计原则与工程权衡。\n\n在云原生架构成为默认选择的今天，数据系统的边界已经模糊——数据库、缓存、消息队列和流处理引擎之间的界限日趋融合。对象存储作为一等公民、存算分离架构的普及、以及 AI 工作负载对存储格式和索引策略的影响，都要求工程师具备跨越单一组件的全局视角。\n\n本知识库从数据系统的底层原理出发，覆盖存储引擎、分布式协调、事务保障和数据处理四大支柱：\n\n第一章**数据存储与检索**，剖析 LSM-Tree 与 B-Tree 两大存储引擎的设计哲学，深入索引结构的演进（从传统 B+ 树到向量索引），并探讨列式存储在 OLAP 场景下的性能优势与工程实现。\n\n第二章**复制与分区**，系统介绍主从复制、多主复制和无主复制三种范式的适用场景与一致性保证，以及数据分区策略在水平扩展中的关键作用，涵盖分区再平衡与热点处理。\n\n第三章**事务与一致性**，从 ACID 语义出发，对比最终一致性（BASE）模型，深入分布式事务的实现机制（2PC、Saga），并系统梳理线性一致性、因果一致性等分布式一致性模型的理论基础与实践选择。\n\n第四章**流处理与批处理**，回顾 MapReduce 到现代统一计算引擎的演进路径，解析 Apache Flink 等流处理框架的状态管理与 Exactly-Once 语义实现，并探讨事件溯源与 CQRS 模式在事件驱动架构中的应用。\n\n推荐学习路径：具备数据库和分布式系统基础的工程师可按顺序学习；关注性能优化的后端开发者建议从第一章存储引擎开始；从事微服务架构的团队可优先阅读第二、三章的复制与事务；数据平台工程师可直接进入第四章的流批处理部分。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-storage-retrieval","title":"数据存储与检索","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/data-storage-retrieval","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"storage-engine-comparison","title":"存储引擎对比：LSM-Tree 与 B-Tree","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/data-storage-retrieval/storage-engine-comparison"},{"seq":2,"slug":"index-structures","title":"索引结构与查询优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/data-storage-retrieval/index-structures"},{"seq":3,"slug":"columnar-storage","title":"列式存储与 OLAP 优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/data-storage-retrieval/columnar-storage"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"replication-and-partitioning","title":"复制与分区","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/replication-and-partitioning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"replication-models","title":"主从复制与多主复制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/replication-and-partitioning/replication-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"partitioning-strategies","title":"分区策略与再平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/replication-and-partitioning/partitioning-strategies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"consistency-and-consensus","title":"复制一致性与共识算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/replication-and-partitioning/consistency-and-consensus"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"transactions-and-consistency","title":"事务与一致性","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/transactions-and-consistency","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"acid-vs-base","title":"ACID 与 BASE：事务语义对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/transactions-and-consistency/acid-vs-base"},{"seq":2,"slug":"distributed-transactions","title":"分布式事务实现机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/transactions-and-consistency/distributed-transactions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"consistency-models","title":"分布式一致性模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/transactions-and-consistency/consistency-models"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"stream-and-batch-processing","title":"流处理与批处理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/stream-and-batch-processing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mapreduce-evolution","title":"MapReduce 演进：从批处理到统一计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/stream-and-batch-processing/mapreduce-evolution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stream-processing-architecture","title":"流处理架构与实时计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/stream-and-batch-processing/stream-processing-architecture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"event-sourcing-cqrs","title":"事件溯源与 CQRS 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-intensive-applications/stream-and-batch-processing/event-sourcing-cqrs"}]}]}